			"Message": "style(Wind): Alphabetize barrel re-exports and normalize spacing\n\nSort the three barrel files (Configuration, Mountain, BootstrapStage) so that named re-exports within each logical category follow alphabetical order, matching the convention established in prior formatting passes.\n\n- **BootstrapStage.ts**: Move `EnvironmentTag` value import below its paired `EnvironmentInfo` type import; remove trailing blank line before the first default-export key.\n- **Configuration.ts**: Reorder 15 re-exported names — errors (Apply→Fetch→Validation), values (Create→Get→Make→Validate), live/mock implementations (ConfigurationLive→ConfigurationMock→…), type aliases (Configuration→ConfigurationService→…).\n- **Mountain.ts**: Reorder 11 re-exported names — errors (Connection→RPC→State→Sync), values (Create→Live→Mock), type aliases (Mountain→MountainConnectionState→…).\n- **Mountain/index.ts**: Add missing blank line separator between the error-types section end and the Live Implementation section header, consistent with the other 19 barrel files.\n\nNo behavioral changes — pure formatting alignment.",
